# 🌱 Seed manifests
# Real source-pool data is curated by the platform admin and stays out
# of the repo. Only the syntactically-valid example templates are
# tracked; anything else under seed/ (e.g. source_pool.production.json)
# is ignored by default.
backend/seed/*
!backend/seed/source_pool.example.json
!backend/seed/source_pool.production.template.json